  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "NEW\n\t\t\t* A project's Types: the top-level types its files declare, a partial type listed once\n\t\t\t* A file's Root: its Roslyn syntax tree, parsed with the build's language version and #if symbols\n\t\t\t* A file's SpanOf(node): where a syntax node or token starts and ends\n\t\t\t* A file's and a project's Members: each member's name, kind, accessibility, parameters and type\n\t\t\t* A file's Uses: the build's types its code uses\n\t\t\t* A type's Exposes: the build's types its signature names where other assemblies see it\n\t\t\t* A project's OpensInternalsTo: the projects its InternalsVisibleTo names\n\t\t\t* A type's Nested: the types declared inside it",
